         <p class="help-text">Pick all options that are used to write software.</p>
         <div class="choices">
           <label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="q1" value="python" data-correct="true" /><span>Python</span></label>
           <label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="q1" value="html" /><span>HTML</span></label>
           <label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="q1" value="javascript" data-correct="true" /><span>JavaScript</span></label>
           <label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="q1" value="photoshop" /><span>Photoshop</span></label>
         </div>
       </div>

       <div class="form-field">
         <h2 class="question-title">2. Which languages are commonly used for web development?</h2>
         <div class="choices">
           <label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="q2" value="css" data-correct="true" /><span>CSS</span></label>
           <label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="q2" value="java" data-correct="true" /><span>Java</span></label>
           <label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="q2" value="swift" /><span>Swift</span></label>
           <label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="q2" value="ruby" data-correct="true" /><span>Ruby</span></label>
         </div>
       </div>

       <div class="form-field">
         <h2 class="question-title">3. Which of these are low-level or systems-oriented languages?</h2>
         <div class="choices">
           <label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="q3" value="c" data-correct="true" /><span>C</span></label>
           <label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="q3" value="assembly" data-correct="true" /><span>Assembly</span></label>
           <label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="q3" value="python" /><span>Python</span></label>
           <label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="q3" value="sql" /><span>SQL</span></label>
